Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:34.49,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,471)\bord2.4\blur1.5\c&HFCFCFD&\fsp3\pos(512.1,1049.715)}World-Splitter -Gladius-
Dialogue: 30,0:01:37.41,0:01:40.50,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,This is the first otherworlder we've encountered.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.92,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Her identifier is Aldea.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:42.92,0:01:46.50,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Her Magitech armor is called Zeeru.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.76,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,In appearance it's similar to a Heart Hybrid Gear,
Dialogue: 30,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.76,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,but its special ability is to warp space.
Dialogue: 30,0:01:55.18,0:01:58.14,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So this is what reflected the Pulverizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:02:00.14,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnAugust Sans Reduced\blur0.6\bord0\fscx35\fscy35\t(0,1340,\c&HCAC4C2&)\b1\fax0.1\frx12\fry190\frz24.11\pos(1149.9,823.99)}Connection Failed
Dialogue: 30,0:01:59.52,0:02:02.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,And it's also what trapped us before, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,She said that the "Batlantis Empire" \Nis on the other side of the Entrances.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:06.44,0:02:10.03,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Is that the enemy who's been \Nsending the Magitech weapons?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:10.03,0:02:11.65,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:11.65,0:02:15.11,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,We've designated the three-headed dragon as a Tri-Head.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:15.11,0:02:18.70,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,Since its power vastly exceeds that of a Category-A weapon,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.16,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,we've also designated a new Super-Category class.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.25,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.88,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We should head back there right away!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:29.88,0:02:30.88,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:30.88,0:02:33.05,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,This mission is complete.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:34.51,0:02:35.68,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:35.68,0:02:38.55,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We can't just ignore such \Na dangerous Magitech weapon!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.60,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,We infiltrated enemy-occupied territory for the first time,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:42.60,0:02:45.02,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,found a new type of Magitech weapon,
Dialogue: 30,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.56,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,discovered and contacted an otherworlder.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:48.11,0:02:50.19,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,That's more than enough for one mission.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.48,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I can't accept that!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:52.48,0:02:54.90,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We should destroy them with everything we have!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.57,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you, Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.99,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.58,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm just suggesting the obvious!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:03.54,0:03:05.96,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,And if we capture that otherworlder,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:05.96,0:03:08.00,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,we can get more information, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.84,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Calm down, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:10.46,0:03:13.84,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,If we go without a plan, we'll just lose again.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.84,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Getting cold feet, are we?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.85,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,After all that bragging about being \Nthe American ace and the strongest?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:20.85,0:03:22.64,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:22.64,0:03:25.23,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hida-kun, you understand, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:26.35,0:03:27.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:28.10,0:03:29.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:46.75,0:03:47.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:54.71,0:03:56.01,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.02,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.03,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:17.24,0:04:18.90,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You came back by yourself?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:19.36,0:04:21.41,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Where's that Magitech weapon?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:22.12,0:04:24.66,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You're not interested in me at all? How rude.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:24.99,0:04:28.04,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like you're the one I'm after, either.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:28.71,0:04:29.42,Dialogue Alternate Batlantis,A,0,0,0,,Zeeru.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:31.29,0:04:33.67,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I have questions for you, too!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.59,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:39.76,0:04:40.72,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:05.66,0:05:07.12,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That strange technique again...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let me show you something even more fun.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.92,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Labyrinth Cube!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.63,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:20.38,0:05:25.22,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The Labyrinth Cube, an inescapable prison made by warping space.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:27.85,0:05:30.89,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I control everything that happens inside it.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.52,0:05:35.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let's see, how about I slice the space into tiny little pieces and rearrange them.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:36.40,0:05:39.44,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Your body will be ripped apart.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:55.75,0:05:59.67,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You'd better let go of our little kitten or you're going to get it!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.81,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You idiot! That was crazy!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:14.81,0:06:17.77,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,H-Hida-kun... But why?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:18.07,0:06:19.69,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I can't let you fight alone!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.28,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We're teammates after all!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:27.74,0:06:30.16,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You need to die, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.13,0:06:44.68,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You really are amazing.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.47,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hey, would you tell me your name?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:48.01,0:06:49.97,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,You should be grateful I'm willing to tell you.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:50.89,0:06:52.72,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,I'm Chidorigafuchi Aine.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.44,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,A-Aine?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:55.64,0:06:59.73,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Would you tell me the name of that Magitech armor, too?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.32,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,Magitech armor?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:02.32,0:07:03.94,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.70,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,This is a Heart Hybrid Gear.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:05.70,0:07:06.49,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,The Zeros.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:08.20,0:07:13.50,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The goddess dances with the void, death, the Emperor, and eternity...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.79,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,Were those your last words?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:17.79,0:07:19.96,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,They didn't make any sense to me!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:20.79,0:07:21.84,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:28.84,0:07:30.39,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 30,0:07:30.39,0:07:32.64,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,You guys can play with him.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:44.82,0:07:45.94,Dialogue,C,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:45.94,0:07:49.49,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,If your Magitech armor is really Zeros,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:49.49,0:07:51.99,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,then show me your power.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:59.00,0:07:59.92,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:00.50,0:08:01.63,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:02.75,0:08:03.80,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:08.84,0:08:10.39,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Your Hybrid Count!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.23,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:16.23,0:08:18.64,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,What kind of fool leaves without permission?!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:21.31,0:08:22.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Nee-chan!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:22.48,0:08:23.40,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Kurumizawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.11,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:26.82,0:08:29.28,Dialogue Italics,R,0,0,0,,Kizuna, Climax Hybrid!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:33.41,0:08:34.99,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,The love room!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:34.99,0:08:36.25,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Let's go, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:47.42,0:08:48.13,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:48.13,0:08:50.38,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm a terrible person!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.76,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I try to correct everyone else's behavior,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:52.76,0:08:54.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,but I cause more trouble than anyone else.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:55.06,0:08:58.64,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,My selfishness put my team in danger!
Dialogue: 30,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.65,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,In the end, this is the kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:03.69,0:09:06.78,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa, did something happen \Nbetween you and that Magitech weapon?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.32,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's not my first time...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:13.37,0:09:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,fighting that Magitech weapon.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:17.87,0:09:20.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,During the Second World Collision,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:20.33,0:09:24.21,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,my mission was to escort\N the evacuees aboard the Megafloat.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:25.59,0:09:30.34,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's when that Magitech weapon appeared.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:39.14,0:09:40.93,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:41.60,0:09:43.40,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything at all!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:45.65,0:09:47.77,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If I had more power...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.78,0:09:50.32,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If I was stronger...
Dialogue: 30,0:09:51.40,0:09:53.07,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I could have protected them!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:54.41,0:09:58.62,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I was arrogant because everyone said I was Japan's ace.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:59.49,0:10:02.66,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I did so many interviews, went to so many parties,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.71,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,that I didn't train as much as I should have.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:05.83,0:10:08.21,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If I'd trained harder
Dialogue: 30,0:10:08.21,0:10:09.76,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,and gotten stronger,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:09.76,0:10:12.22,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I could have saved so many lives!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:12.97,0:10:16.68,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I don't want to make that mistake ever again!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:17.68,0:10:20.22,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I control myself, discipline myself,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:20.60,0:10:22.60,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,live an orderly life,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.06,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,abandon my worldly desires,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:24.06,0:10:25.94,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,and train every day,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:25.94,0:10:28.52,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,so that I can give everything I have to my mission.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:29.44,0:10:31.61,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's the way I decided to live from then on.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:32.36,0:10:33.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:33.57,0:10:36.62,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You shouldn't just focus on the lives you couldn't save.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:37.03,0:10:40.12,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There are lots of lives you have saved.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.87,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:41.87,0:10:44.12,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Show me one person I've saved.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.67,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There's one right in front of you.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:47.29,0:10:49.75,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,When I first came to Ataraxia,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:49.75,0:10:52.51,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,you saved me from that Viking, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:54.97,0:10:57.34,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,B-But even if I hadn't saved you—
Dialogue: 30,0:10:57.34,0:11:00.06,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I couldn't fight back then.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You saved me,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:03.18,0:11:06.48,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,which is why I was able to save Julicia and Aine later.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:07.44,0:11:09.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You've saved a lot of people.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:09.23,0:11:11.32,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You just don't realize it.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:11.32,0:11:12.78,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:12.78,0:11:14.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:15.11,0:11:18.49,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,What could you possibly know?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:19.28,0:11:24.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I had a Heart Hybrid Gear, but I couldn't fight.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I had to protect other people,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:26.71,0:11:29.00,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but in reality, I couldn't even protect myself.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.50,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:32.13,0:11:35.30,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,if the two of us work together, we can fight.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:35.30,0:11:38.76,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,If we Climax Hybrid and bring out \Nthe Immoral Weapon lying dormant within you,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.10,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,we can defeat the Tri-Head.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:40.97,0:11:44.10,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,We can defeat the Tri-Head?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:44.10,0:11:45.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:45.23,0:11:49.15,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,If we work... together?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:51.31,0:11:52.65,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Will you do it?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:09.79,0:12:11.17,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:20.05,0:12:22.72,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Your breasts are very shapely.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Can you show them to me?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:25.18,0:12:29.02,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I don't know how you can say something so obscene with a straight face.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:30.44,0:12:34.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You think my breasts are small, don't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:34.86,0:12:36.23,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.11,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:39.11,0:12:41.78,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I know you compare them \Nto Aine-san's and Julicia-san's!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:46.58,0:12:49.41,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,N-No! Not there!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:49.41,0:12:52.38,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,N-No, I can't!
Dialogue: 30,0:12:52.38,0:12:54.21,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,You're pretty sensitive, aren't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.84,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,N-No, th-this is...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:56.76,0:13:00.84,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Your breasts are every bit as good as Aine's and Julicia's.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:00.84,0:13:04.14,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:04.14,0:13:04.85,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:06.14,0:13:07.35,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.53,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:24.74,0:13:27.74,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,N-No! This is too embarrassing!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:42.34,0:13:46.35,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So this is a Heart Hybrid...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:46.35,0:13:49.60,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's like the whole world's changed.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We're just getting started.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.57,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Hida-kun, what's this?
Dialogue: 30,0:13:58.94,0:14:02.07,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I prepared a situation I thought you'd like.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.36,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,B-But this...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:05.32,0:14:08.83,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I don't see why I would like this!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:11.87,0:14:12.96,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:23.34,0:14:25.43,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:25.43,0:14:28.05,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:28.05,0:14:31.02,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Please, don't touch me there!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:32.18,0:14:34.27,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I-I told you not to!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:48.12,0:14:51.24,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Himekawa, is this... No way!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:52.54,0:14:54.16,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I-I don't meow!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.50,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Don't ask!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.50,0:14:57.83,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,It's nothing! Nothing at all!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.05,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Don't grab it!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:00.05,0:15:00.71,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.47,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Himekawa?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.89,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.89,0:15:17.40,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So don't grab my tail anymore.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.61,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:20.94,0:15:24.53,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,We have to make our Climax Hybrid a success.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:39.38,0:15:43.55,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,So this is a Climax Hybrid...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.64,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.56,Dialogue Alternate,H,0,0,0,,Neros!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:33.85,0:16:35.10,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Gladius!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:47.03,0:16:49.36,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Himekawa Hayuru! Here I come!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:50.41,0:16:52.62,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,I'll never forget how I failed to protect Japan,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:52.62,0:16:55.54,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,or that girl's smile,
Dialogue: 30,0:16:56.83,0:16:58.66,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,or simply all the people I couldn't save.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.83,Dialogue Italics,H,0,0,0,,But I won't let it stop me anymore!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:09.76,0:17:10.47,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Begone.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.14,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,In one hit?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:18.14,0:17:20.06,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.56,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,I could tell you,
Dialogue: 30,0:17:22.73,0:17:24.94,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,but there are things we want to learn from you first!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:25.57,0:17:28.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I just saw how all of you fight, so...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:29.32,0:17:31.36,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll beat me that easily!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:43.46,0:17:45.34,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Eros has no weapons.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:45.34,0:17:48.05,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Is there no point in doing a Climax Hybrid with it?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.76,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,If only I had a weapon, too...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:53.72,0:17:54.59,Dialogue Italics,K,0,0,0,,Is this...?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:01.68,0:18:03.31,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.65,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Neros' blade?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:08.65,0:18:11.32,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,It's probably an effect of \Nhis Climax Hybrid with Himekawa.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:11.99,0:18:12.82,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:12.82,0:18:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,does this mean Eros can also create weapons?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:16.83,0:18:19.37,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,That's an interesting power you've got.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:22.83,0:18:24.33,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:34.55,0:18:36.18,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:38.93,0:18:41.98,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I didn't expect this to be so much fun.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:41.98,0:18:45.02,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came to Lemuria after all.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.28,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Enemy battleship incoming!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:51.28,0:18:52.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,500-meter class!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.32,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Three more of them!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.49,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,And four 1000-meter class ships!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.59,0:18:58.49,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnGill Sans Std\c&HF1E4D0&\bord0\blur1.2\b1\fscx80\fscy80\frz20.18\pos(624,407.5)\frx2\fry356}S{\1a&HFF&\t(262,262,\1a&H00&)}o {\1a&HFF&\t(524,524,\1a&H00&)}m{\1a&HFF&\t(786,786,\1a&H00&)}a{\1a&HFF&\t(1048,1048,\1a&H00&)}n{\1a&HFF&\t(1310,1310,\1a&H00&)}y
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:58.49,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnGill Sans Std\fax0.05\c&H864F2C&\bord0\blur7.5\b1\fscx80\fscy80\frz20.18\pos(622.629,408.757)\frx2\fry356}S{\1a&HFF&\t(262,262,\1a&H00&)}o {\1a&HFF&\t(524,524,\1a&H00&)}m{\1a&HFF&\t(786,786,\1a&H00&)}a{\1a&HFF&\t(1048,1048,\1a&H00&)}n{\1a&HFF&\t(1310,1310,\1a&H00&)}y
Dialogue: 30,0:18:57.37,0:18:57.91,Dialogue Italics,Gi,0,0,0,,So many—
Dialogue: 30,0:18:57.91,0:18:59.87,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,2000-meter class, incoming!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.75,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,The party's just getting started.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.83,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Let's start the killing game.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:24.68,0:19:25.60,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.35,Dialogue,K,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.35,0:19:29.77,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Is that from the otherworld?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:30.73,0:19:31.94,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:31.94,0:19:33.32,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,They're on our side.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:34.15,0:19:35.49,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,That light...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.45,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,America's Heart Hybrid Gear unit.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:38.45,0:19:39.66,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,The Masters.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:39.66,0:19:42.08,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,This is getting even more fun.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.20,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Now, let's dance—
Dialogue: 30,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.25,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,Aldea.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:45.16,0:19:46.75,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,You're satisfied, right?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.75,0:19:48.17,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:48.58,0:19:49.54,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Grabel.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.09,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:51.09,0:19:53.92,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,I came to apprehend an idiot who disobeyed orders
Dialogue: 30,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.88,Dialogue Italics,G,0,0,0,,and broke regulations.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:55.88,0:19:57.76,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Don't be a wet blanket.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.68,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Things are just about to get good.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:59.68,0:20:00.93,Dialogue,G,0,0,0,,Aldea!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:02.35,0:20:03.93,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:10.27,0:20:13.40,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet is retreating into the Entrance!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:15.28,0:20:18.36,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,It's a message from Megafloat West USA.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:18.99,0:20:22.95,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,"Hi, girls. The cavalry is here.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:23.62,0:20:26.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're safe now that we're here.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:26.16,0:20:30.46,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Start choosing your dresses for the victory party."
Dialogue: 30,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.71,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,Ask them what they're doing here.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:33.25,0:20:36.42,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Um, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:38.63,0:20:39.38,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:39.38,0:20:41.18,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,You're tracing a mysterious radio signal?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.22,Dialogue,R,0,0,0,,So the same thing as us?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:49.81,0:20:53.44,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Did that fleet come just to get Aldea?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.73,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,I'm curious about the otherworld.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:56.73,0:21:00.74,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,But I'm more curious about you, Hayuru.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.99,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Wh-Why is that?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:02.99,0:21:07.12,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You clearly did a Climax Hybrid, didn't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:07.45,0:21:08.91,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.91,0:21:11.87,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,Hayuru never shuts up about\N how she hates obscene things.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:11.87,0:21:13.25,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,No, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:13.63,0:21:17.17,Dialogue,A,0,0,0,,I can't believe anybody but me could do\N a Climax Hybrid with Kizuna.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.38,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:19.38,0:21:21.01,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,Kizuna-kun and I did, together!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:25.26,0:21:27.89,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,But it was for the mission. I didn't have a choice!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:27.89,0:21:30.98,Dialogue,H,0,0,0,,I won't let you do anything\N indecent that's not necessary.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:30.98,0:21:32.02,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Oh, noes!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:33.73,0:21:36.69,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,The party's already over?!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:36.69,0:21:40.32,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Well, I guess they must have gotten scared of us and ran.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:41.24,0:21:42.53,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,Scarlet?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:44.74,0:21:46.41,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,It's been forever.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:46.41,0:21:47.49,Dialogue,Y,0,0,0,,You seem to be doing well.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:47.49,0:21:49.16,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:50.29,0:21:51.66,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:51.66,0:21:54.96,Dialogue,Gi,0,0,0,,never gonna forgive you!
